flowchart TD
  step1["Write an unsent fictional draft with reply/mention choices in A; disconnect only the owned device from the fixture server."]
  step2["Attempt send and let a history poll/search fail; inspect pending/error presentation."]
  step3["Restore transport while current membership is unchanged; reopen A and explicitly resume the intended send."]
  step4["Read current server history and verify no invented accepted/read state during the offline interval."]
  record["Compare every expected result; record PASS, FAIL or BLOCKED for this run"]
  step1 --> step2
  step2 --> step3
  step3 --> step4
  step4 --> record
